@startuml
title GenClaw 精简架构图

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #92400E
  BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
}
skinparam cloud {
  BorderColor #1D4ED8
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
}

actor "用户" as User

component "CLI\n`genclaw run/render/review`" as CLI
component "Pipeline + GraphNodes\n编排主流程" as Flow
component "CanvasPlan\n中心结构化契约" as Plan
component "Renderer\nSVG / HTML / Three.js / Python" as Renderer
component "ImageGenerator\nsketch -> final" as Generator
component "Reviewer\n规则检查 + 可选 VLM" as Reviewer

cloud "外部能力\nLLM / Search / 图像模型" as Services

database "运行产物\nrequest.json\nplan.json\ncanvas.*\nsketch.png\nfinal.png\nreview.json\ntrace.jsonl" as Artifacts

User --> CLI : 输入 prompt
CLI --> Flow : 启动流程

Flow --> Services : 可选 search + LLM conceptualize
Flow --> Plan : 生成 / 更新

Plan --> Renderer : 作为画布契约
Renderer --> Artifacts : canvas.* + sketch.png

Renderer --> Generator : sketch.png
Generator --> Services : 图像生成 / 编辑
Generator --> Artifacts : final.png

Plan --> Reviewer : 提供检查目标
Generator --> Reviewer : 提供 final.png
Reviewer --> Services : 可选 VLM 审查
Reviewer --> Artifacts : review.json

Flow --> Reviewer : review / revise loop
Flow --> Artifacts : request.json + trace.jsonl

note bottom of Plan
  关键边界:
  Agent 产出 CanvasPlan,
  Renderer 和 Reviewer 都围绕它工作。
end note

note bottom of Flow
  主链:
  search -> conceptualize -> render -> generate -> review
end note

legend right
  |= 形状 |= 含义 |
  | component | 本地核心模块 |
  | cloud | 外部模型或服务 |
  | database | 落盘产物 |
endlegend

@enduml
